codex
The first implementation checks out on construction and both solvers. At the hard preset, a representative instance has a 657-letter equation word and a 219-letter witness, while the compact solver now counts only 94 exact post-insight operations; the literal Nielsen solver scans tens of thousands of word symbols. I found and fixed a boundedness bug in one attack generator before starting the full 200,000-sample gate run.
