The gate run is progressing normally; the sampling prior is intentionally demanding—uniform over the exact multiset permutations printed in the problem, not over arbitrary words. This representative shipping space has 73 decimal digits, but the gate will report the observed valid fraction rather than treating cardinality as evidence of hardness.
