codex
I have written the README with the successful local evidence and an explicit non-release warning for the unavailable oracle evidence. I’m also invoking the two G9 arms through the required script in isolated directories; if quota remains exhausted, their script-owned error transcripts will be retained as diagnostics, never counted as failed solver attempts.
