The post-change rerun passes all nine local gates again. Final measurements are 0/200,000 guesses, 1 exact demo solution, four attacks at 0/8, reference and compact solvers at 8/8, 154,067 reference scans versus 142 compact operations, and a 66-token exact worst-case bound. I’m synchronizing the README/profile timings and doing a final interface/JSON audit; the only unresolved gate remains the provider-owned oracle quota.
