 ## Caveats
 
-The benchmark is easy with a free-group package or the implemented reference
-solver; that is the reason for Track B.  The sampled density is relative to
-uniform permutations of the disclosed multisets and is not a proof of
-uniqueness at hard size.  The exact length and letter-count side constraints
